ttps://t.co/Ruyipx03yk", "url": "https://x.com/CarNewsChina/status/2116792894233137237"}, {"author_id": "1602182754883571719", "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:58:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116983146419757474"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The grid is changing rapidly, battery storage durations are getting longer, and chemistries are changing too.", "display_url": "reneweconomy.com.au/big-battery-du…", "end": 240, "expanded_url": "https://reneweconomy.com.au/big-battery-durations-are-headed-to-double-figures-and-their-chemistries-are-changing-again/", "images": [{"height": 845, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116550625429188608/O8he95O_?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1268}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116550625429188608/O8he95O_?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 217, "status": 200, "title": "Big battery durations are headed to double figures, and their chemistries are changing - again", "unwound_url": "https://reneweconomy.com.au/big-battery-durations-are-headed-to-double-figures-and-their-chemistries-are-changing-again/", "url": "https://t.co/KQzcyh6O0v"}]}, "id": "2116983146419757474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Chemistries are shifting from lithium NMC and LFP toward sodium-ion (e.g., CATL's Tener) and nickel-hydrogen (e.g., EnerVenue's tech from Hubble heritage), offering longer discharge, 40,000 cycles, and no fire risk.\n\nhttps://t.co/KQzcyh6O0v", "url": "https://x.com/Ab_1_1_1_1/status/2116983146419757474"}, {"author_id": "2184934963", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:27:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116703740950716540"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "CATL and Intilion signed an MOU Monday to install 3 GWh of sodium-ion energy storage systems in Europe by 2031.", "display_url": "interestingengineering.com/energy/catl-in…", "end": 226, "expanded_url": "https://interestingengineering.com/energy/catl-intilion-plan-3-gwh-sodium-ion-energy-grid", "images": [{"height": 1080, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115621399205453824/rtytx4o1?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115621399205453824/rtytx4o1?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 203, "status": 200, "title": "Sodium batteries target 3 GWh of storage with 15,000 charge cycles", "unwound_url": "https://interestingengineering.com/energy/catl-intilion-plan-3-gwh-sodium-ion-energy-grid", "url": "https://t.co/UjfyIBICiN"}]}, "id": "2116703740950716540", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 679, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Sodium-ion batteries target 3 GWh of grid storage by 2031 with 15,000 charge cycles\n\nChina’s CATL and Germany’s Intilion plan a 3 GWh European sodium battery rollout by 2031, with 15,000 charge cycles.\n\nhttps://t.co/UjfyIBICiN", "url": "https://x.com/ECOWARRIORSS/status/2116703740950716540"}, {"author_id": "2014257062889271296", "created_at": "2026-11-01T05:14:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116760882625519755"], "id": "2116760882625519755", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Colossus 2 isn't just waiting for the grid.\n\nSouthaven has a permitted 1.2 GW gas-power project, but its approval faces legal challenges. Temporary turbines are already part of the power strategy.\n\nBuilding your own generation can shorten the wait for electricity. It also shifts", "url": "https://x.com/StragglerLiu/status/2116760882625519755"}, {"author_id": "1959229231", "created_at": "2026-10-31T09:46:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116466850431467917"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/C0DqKRNVoT", "end": 253, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheMinuend/status/2116466850431467917/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116465756691156992", "start": 230, "url": "https://t.co/C0DqKRNVoT"}, {"display_url": "x.com/TheMinuend/sta…", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheMinuend/status/2116465635781992767", "start": 254, "url": "https://t.co/OaAynNnDl6"}]}, "id": "2116466850431467917", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 554, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116465635781992767", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "NTPC's EOI is much broader, evaluating which sodium-ion tech deserves further development &amp; potential procurement—with an indigenous cell mfg focus. Jaipur's RFP is checking Na-ion deserves a place in discom investment plans. https://t.co/C0DqKRNVoT https://t.co/OaAynNnDl6", "url": "https://x.com/TheMinuend/status/2116466850431467917"}, {"author_id": "1265620178026418183", "created_at": "2026-11-01T19:22:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116974245993754953"], "id": "2116974245993754953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Battery Industry Weekly: 6 developments (26 Oct – 1 Nov 2026)\n\n1. CATL and Intilion sign an MoU for up to 3 GWh of sodium-ion storage across Germany, Austria and Switzerland over five years.", "url": "https://x.com/batterybriefs/status/2116974245993754953"}, {"author_id": "2111320881385639936", "created_at": "2026-11-01T03:24:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116733117159661971"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 244, "start": 230, "tag": "EnergyStorage"}], "urls": [{"description": "Global Energy Alliance and JVVNL launch sodium-ion battery storage pilot in India to strengthen grid reliability and solar integration.", "display_url": "energyalliance.org/india-first-so…", "end": 229, "expanded_url": "https://energyalliance.org/india-first-sodium-ion-battery-storage-pilot-jaipur/", "images": [{"height": 1648